  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel like this is a fairly basic request, but a \"Remember Me\" button would be extremely handy for VRChat, especially as re-typing your information repeatedly on a Virtual Keyboard can be tiring and repetitive-- And while Crashes and Errors are still a thing, Multiple Logins will be as well.\nI'm sure you've heard this plenty, but there was an excellent mod for this exact purpose before and without it the tedium of re-logins has really shown. \nPersonally, I think it's an important and fairly simple addition for QoL, and would benefit literally all users across the board. Hope to see this eventually! Thank you, VRC Team!",
